Who were the key figures involved in the hostage crisis at the US Embassy in Tehran in 1979?
Based on the provided context, the key figures involved in the hostage crisis at the US Embassy in Tehran in 1979 were:

* Robert Anders
* Cora Amburn-Lijek
* Mark Lijek
* Joseph Stafford
* Kathleen Stafford
* Lee Schatz
* Kenneth Kraus (a Marine who was taken hostage)
* Ambassador William Sullivan
* Iranian Foreign Minister Ebrahim Yazdi
* Ayatollah Mohammad Beheshti (who set up the Office for Strengthening Unity, which played a central role in the seizure of the US embassy)
* Mahmoud Ahmadinejad (a member of the OSU central council)
* Ebrahim Asgharzadeh (a member of the OSU central council)
* Mohsen Kadivar (a member of the OSU central council)
* Mohsen Aghajari (a member of the OSU central council)
* Abbas Abdi (a member of the OSU central council)
* Kenneth D. Taylor (Canada's ambassador to Iran, who played a key role in resolving the crisis through the "Canadian Caper")
